-- Teaching loads (assignments) of FCIM, autumn semester 2026/2027, read from the timetable on
-- https://fcim.utm.md/orar-sectia-zi-2/ (October 2026, 2144 entries of years I-IV).
-- Run it once, on a database that has the teachers, groups and subjects loaded and no assignments yet
-- (it stops with a message if there are assignments). To do it again: delete from assignment;
--
-- How the entries became assignments:
--   * subject: the site's name (abbreviated, with "c." / "lab." in front, or misspelt) is matched to a subject of the
--     database that the group is allowed to have (by its cluster tags); the autumn semester and the group's year win ties.
--   * teacher: the full name on the site, else surname + first initial when that is one teacher.
--   * kind: curs = lecture, sem = seminar, lab = lab, proiect = project.
--   * groups: the groups that have the same subject, kind and teacher in the same day and pair are one class: one group
--     is a plain group assignment, several groups are a joint class (a stream made automatically from them).
--   * pairs: the number of different day and pair cells of the class in a week; the load has no odd/even weeks, so a pair
--     held every other week counts as a pair, and when a class has both weekly and alternating cells the load is
--     added up and rounded up (a half pair counts 0.5).
--   * "1) lab. 0.5 gr" / "2) lab. 0.5 gr" in one cell: the group is split in two subgroups (its `subgroups` becomes 2).
--   * 52 entries list two teachers: the first one is kept.
--
-- 941 assignments. Left out (169 entries of the site):
--   138  subject not found
--   19  group not in the database
--   8  teacher not in the database
--   4  no teacher on the site
